    {
      "id": 2,
      "status": "published",
      "intro_text": "<p>The responsible design and use of AI and data are difficult, but there is an urgent need for it in our current ecosystem. When organizations adopt new technologies without regard to the wider social, economic, cultural, and political contexts, they can endanger privacy and security and exacerbate inequities in ways that are difficult to reverse.</p>",
