    {
      "id": 4,
      "status": "published",
      "intro_text": "<p>This course is designed to raise awareness of the societal impacts of technology, and to give individuals and institutions the tools to pursue the responsible and ethical use of AI and data. Intended for current and future data scientists, policymakers, and business leaders, we launch new lectures on the first Monday of the month on topics related to data and AI. Each module consists of a video lecture accompanied by additional resources such as videos, readings, and podcasts.</p>",
